            "$D^T D = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{bmatrix} 2I & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2I \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} I & 0 \\\\ 0 & I \\end{bmatrix} = I_4$",
